# Skybound Import Tooling

This directory contains the reproducible, standard-library-only importer used to normalize the
Skybound source workbook into `skybound-manifest.json` and Flyway migration V312.

- Treat the supplied workbook as untrusted source data; normalization and overrides in
  `build_skybound_import.py` are authoritative only where reviewed against the printed cards.
- Keep production IDs generated by the migration; never embed the local Skybound set UUID.
- Collector numbers 419–472 are released alternate-art characters and must resolve to their
  non-foil source images. Collector 450 includes both front and reverse faces.
- Do not publish foil-production source images. Foil rows reuse non-foil art and the UI sheen.
- Treat a `NNNF_` source filename as a foil printing even if the workbook collector-number cell
  contains only `NNN`; the filename is the authoritative foil marker.
- Regenerate outputs deliberately and review the full SQL/manifest diff before committing.
